# `npx storybook tools` and `storybook build` run a TypeScript program of the whole
# app for the docgen of the component manifest. It needs more than the default
# heap of about 4 GB. With less, the docgen stops after its timeout, and
# `storybook tools docs list` silently drops the docs of most components.
# pnpm and npx apply this to each command that they start in apps/ui.
node-options=--max-old-space-size=6144
